# SMS ingest → inbox, against your LOCAL backend (Neon dev). Never point this at production.
#
# Needs the VS Code "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client): click "Send Request" above each block.
#   1. Start the backend:  cd backend; .venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1; uvicorn app.main:app --reload
#   2. Set the last-4 digits below to one of your dev accounts and one of your dev cards,
#      so the SMS get matched (otherwise they show "No account or card ending …").
#   3. Send the /ingest requests, then log in and look at the inbox (or open /inbox in the app).
#
# The SMS texts are made-up generic wording, not real bank formats.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@accountLast4 = 1234
@cardLast4 = 9876


### 1. Debit from a bank account via UPI (→ pending expense, matched to your account)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ingest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Rs 250.00 sent from A/c XX{{accountLast4}} to chai.point@okhdfcbank on {{$datetime 'DD-MM-YY'}}. UPI Ref No {{$randomInt 100000000000 999999999999}}",
  "sender": "AX-TESTBK",
  "received_at": "{{$datetime iso8601}}"
}

### 2. Card spend at a shop (→ pending expense on your card)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ingest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Rs 1,800.00 spent on card x{{cardLast4}} at TOIT BREWPUB on {{$datetime 'DD-MM-YY'}}. Avl Lmt Rs 45,000",
  "sender": "AX-TESTBK",
  "received_at": "{{$datetime iso8601}}"
}

### 3. Money received (→ pending income; approve it as "Friend paid me back" to settle a split)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ingest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Rs 900.00 received in A/c XX{{accountLast4}} from ravi@okaxis. UPI Ref {{$randomInt 100000000000 999999999999}}",
  "sender": "AX-TESTBK",
  "received_at": "{{$datetime iso8601}}"
}

### 4. Credit-card bill payment (→ suggested as "Card bill", not income/expense)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ingest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Payment of Rs 5,000.00 received towards your credit card XX{{cardLast4}}. Thank you",
  "sender": "AX-TESTBK",
  "received_at": "{{$datetime iso8601}}"
}

### 5. UPI collect request — no money moved (→ "Not money" tab, never in the inbox)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ingest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "shop@okaxis has requested Rs 500 from you. Approve in your UPI app",
  "sender": "AX-TESTBK",
  "received_at": "{{$datetime iso8601}}"
}

### 6. Bill reminder — no money moved (→ "Not money")
POST {{baseUrl}}/ingest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Your credit card bill of Rs 12,000 is due on 25-11-2026",
  "sender": "AX-TESTBK",
  "received_at": "{{$datetime iso8601}}"
}

### 7. OTP — answered {"ok": true} but NOT stored at all
POST {{baseUrl}}/ingest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "123456 is your OTP for a payment of Rs 500. Do not share it",
  "sender": "AX-TESTBK",
  "received_at": "{{$datetime iso8601}}"
}

### 8. Unknown card (→ pending, flagged "No account or card ending 5555")
POST {{baseUrl}}/ingest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Rs 99.00 spent on card x5555 at SOME SHOP",
  "sender": "AX-TESTBK",
  "received_at": "{{$datetime iso8601}}"
}

### 9a. Exact repeat: send this one TWICE within the same minute → stored once
POST {{baseUrl}}/ingest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Rs 42.00 debited from A/c XX{{accountLast4}} at TEA STALL",
  "sender": "AX-TESTBK",
  "received_at": "{{$datetime iso8601}}"
}

### 9b. Possible duplicate: same amount + same last 4 within 10 min, different wording → flagged, not deleted
POST {{baseUrl}}/ingest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Rs 42.00 spent using A/c XX{{accountLast4}} at TEA STALL PVT",
  "sender": "AX-TESTBK",
  "received_at": "{{$datetime iso8601}}"
}

### 10. Full card number in the text → saved masked as XXXXXXXXXXXX1234
POST {{baseUrl}}/ingest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Rs 10.00 spent on card 4111 1111 1111 {{cardLast4}} at TEST MERCHANT",
  "sender": "AX-TESTBK"
}

### 11. Text over 1000 characters → 422 (the text is not echoed back)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ingest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": ""
}

### 12. Only "create": anything but POST is refused (405)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ingest


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Look at the result. Log in first: REST Client asks for your username and password when you
# send this (nothing is saved in this file). The token is reused by the requests below.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Log in
# @name login
# @prompt username
# @prompt password
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Inbox: waiting for review (newest first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/inbox
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Inbox: rejected ("Not money": requests, reminders)
GET {{baseUrl}}/inbox?status=rejected
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Inbox: ignored (incl. repeats of an earlier UPI ref)
GET {{baseUrl}}/inbox?status=ignored
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Pending count + when the last SMS arrived (nav badge / 3-day banner)
GET {{baseUrl}}/inbox/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
